    {
      "displayText": "¿Spew?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 4936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0053007000650077003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿7",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 4952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muchísimas gracias por encontrar a todos\nnuestros Spewpa!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 4964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00750063006800ED00730069006D006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200065006E0063006F006E00740072006100720020006100200074006F0064006F0073000A006E00750065007300740072006F00730020005300700065007700700061002100100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, muchísimas gracias... Deberíamos contarlos\npara asegurarnos de que estén todos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƘ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 5092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uno, dos, tres, cuatro, cinco, seis...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 5268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E006F002C00200064006F0073002C00200074007200650073002C002000630075006100740072006F002C002000630069006E0063006F002C00200073006500690073002E002E002E00100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siete, ocho, nueve, diez, once, doce...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƘ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 5356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069006500740065002C0020006F00630068006F002C0020006E0075006500760065002C0020006400690065007A002C0020006F006E00630065002C00200064006F00630065002E002E002E00100002011401980000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Trece?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 5444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF00540072006500630065003F002100100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Cómo?! ¡Hay uno de más!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 5472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF004300F3006D006F003F0021002000A100480061007900200075006E006F0020006400650020006D00E10073002100100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué vamos a hacer? No podemos llevar más...\nYo llevo seis, tú llevas seis...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƘ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 5532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nuestra familia ya está completa, así que lo mejor\nserá que est<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa se haga cargo de él.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi lo dejamos aquí, ensuciará las piezas\ndel museo y nos meteremos en problemas.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 5696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 197
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, parece que tienes las cajas llenas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNos quedaremos aquí vigilando a Spewpa hasta\nque hagas un espacio y vengas a buscarlo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 6092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tal vez nuestros Spewpa solo querían encontrar\na un nuevo miembro para la familia...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƘ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 6360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muchas gracias por encontrar a nuestros\npequeñitos!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 6540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D007500630068006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200065006E0063006F006E0074007200610072002000610020006E00750065007300740072006F0073000A0070006500710075006500F100690074006F0073002100100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    }
